  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Enhanced muscle fibers can make even some ‘ganics fight like borgs.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Implanted Linear Frame (Any) Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The user’s limbs are considered Cyberlimbs for the purposes of damaging Steel Cover if they were not already, but not for Falling or any other Cyberware Options or Enhancements. Additionally, whenever the user strikes Cover of any material with a Brawling or Martial Arts Attack, they deal 1d6 additional damage to the Cover (and only Cover).</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Implanted Linear Frame β (Beta) or ∑ (Sigma)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fits any implanted Linear Frame, including the named ones (Fūma Kotarō, LF-001 SWAT, Vermilion), not only the Beta and Sigma.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Borgware).</em></p>"
